Yes, we have several vegetarian dishes.

10
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:55,023
Can we park at the restaurant?

11
00:00:55,233 --> 00:00:57,733
Yes, the car park is right behind the restaurant.

12
00:00:57,933 --> 00:01:00,933
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
